#: iot-data-widget.php
msgid "IoT Data Widget – Home Assistant, MQTT & Smart Home Sensors"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: iot-data-widget.php
msgid "Displays live data from smart home devices (Home Assistant, REST API, MQTT, Shelly/Tasmota/ESPHome presets, Shelly Cloud) on your website via shortcode and Gutenberg block, with a guided setup wizard, a redesigned and auto-refreshing appearance, and a built-in diagnostics page. Pro adds threshold alerts, email reports, and a public embed mode."
msgstr ""

